From edd41f0f54d602929ddb1627b168153d0e884511 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:44:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] fix(cl): seat the opening rapid over its entry point
 (held work)

Held work for #2901, not complete. The opening rapid of a
clearance-seeded path starts over its own entry on the clearance plane;
the op stamp salt moves v3 -> v4; wcs_start pins the corner and centre
WCS, the clamp on the old line and a v3 cache that reads Stale.

Open: stale_rapid_law loses its RapidInStock verdict (a clearance plane
under the stock top is no longer convicted), and three committed example
projects read Stale under the new salt.

Refs #2901

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
